{"id":17421018008,"name":"Obby but you're a Spider [🎮]","desc":"🕷️ Escape a cave as a Spider!\n🕸️ Swing from webs, climb walls, and EAT OTHERS\n\ncurrent height: 1000m\n\n📱💻🎮 Supports Mobile, Desktop & Console\n✨ Inspired by Spincynical's 'Obby but you're a Spider'","path":"/game/17421018008-obby-but-you-re-a-spider","slug":"17421018008-obby-but-you-re-a-spider","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/dc83cb05394ecf835b1eeccfea7836a7464cc8de019a88a1a89c2bedc5e1be27.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-cf31e67668e49284ccd59d2aea30db9c/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":14,"visitor":63412820,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-10-24T15:16:06.778Z","creator":{"name":"Banjo Spider Lady","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"Obby-but-you're-a-Spider-uto-teleport-to-checkpoint-20971","_id":"671a64b6af6156bc22adce77","title":"uto teleport to checkpoint","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c7880e","gameId":17421018008,"name":"Obby but you're a Spider [🎮]","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":17421018008},"features":"Auto teleport to checkpoint plus auto farm","tags":[],"script":"local player = game.Players.LocalPlayer\nlocal checkpointsFolder = workspace.Level.Checkpoints\n\nlocal function teleportToCheckpoint(checkpointNumber)\n    local checkpoint = checkpointsFolder:FindFirstChild(\"Checkpoint\" .. checkpointNumber)\n    if checkpoint then\n        player.Character:SetPrimaryPartCFrame(checkpoint.CFrame)\n    end\nend\n\nfor i = 1, 7 do\n    wait(2)\n    teleportToCheckpoint(i)\n    \n    if i == 7 then\n        break\n    end\nend","owner":{"_id":"66cdd57cd38dc78bf695669a","username":"Goodguy29","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-profile.webp","original":null},"status":"offline","id":"66cdd